# Batch 2 / C3 — import-reference literals are not symbol definitions.
#
# The explorer can prove the answer by reading the target file's import
# block and emitting `anchor_kind=import` evidence plus an
# aggregate_facts.member_set. The extractor/finalizer must consume those
# typed literal-reference rows directly instead of trying to materialize
# imported package paths through emit_answer_symbol as source definitions.
#
# Cross-language note: AnchorImport represents import/use/require-style
# dependency references. This case uses a Go source file because it is stable
# inside this repo, but the contract being tested is language-neutral:
# display import/reference literals with citations, do not force them through
# declaration-symbol gates.

ID="qf_import_literal_references"
NAME="import literal references — aggregate member_set stays non-symbol"
QUESTION="internal/agent/explorer.go 这个文件 import 了哪些 internal/ 开头的 package？逐个列出完整 import 路径，只列这些 import 引用字面量，不要把它们当作被导入包里的 symbol 定义来解释。"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="internal/agent/explorer.go github.com/hanchaoqun/codrax/internal/types"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="github\\.com/hanchaoqun/codrax/internal/analysis/dataflow
github\\.com/hanchaoqun/codrax/internal/analysis/declarative
github\\.com/hanchaoqun/codrax/internal/analysis/normalizer
github\\.com/hanchaoqun/codrax/internal/analysis/subject
github\\.com/hanchaoqun/codrax/internal/context
github\\.com/hanchaoqun/codrax/internal/llm
github\\.com/hanchaoqun/codrax/internal/logging
github\\.com/hanchaoqun/codrax/internal/skill
github\\.com/hanchaoqun/codrax/internal/tool
github\\.com/hanchaoqun/codrax/internal/tool/ground
github\\.com/hanchaoqun/codrax/internal/tool/repomap
github\\.com/hanchaoqun/codrax/internal/tool/repomap/multigraph
github\\.com/hanchaoqun/codrax/internal/tool/repomap/types
github\\.com/hanchaoqun/codrax/internal/types"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="standard.library stdlib gopkg.in/yaml.v3"
